<title>JAPAN: Toyo Radiator - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Radiator - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.70		vs	   23.75</p>
<p> Operating	  698    million    vs	  724    million</p>
<p> Current	    783    million    vs	  910    million</p>
<p> Net		  340    million    vs	  450    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.56 yen	  vs	    6.02 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     75 million	  vs	  75 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Radiator Co Ltd is a manufacturer of heat exchangers belonging to the Hitachi group.</p>
</text>
